WEBVTT

00:06.477 --> 00:09.007
The Great Kha'an was poisoned.

00:09.007 --> 00:11.747
But if it wasn't you...

00:11.747 --> 00:13.627
That would mean it was Töregene.

00:15.587 --> 00:17.697
The guardian spirits have spoken.

00:17.697 --> 00:21.597
Saving the patient requires 
a sacrifice in his stead.

00:21.597 --> 00:24.887
One of you must drink 
every last drop of this water.

00:26.917 --> 00:28.347
So it should be me.

00:50.927 --> 00:53.627
<b>Jaadugar</b>

02:11.927 --> 02:16.417
<b>Wisdom</b>

02:23.747 --> 02:25.627
<i>It hurts.</i>

02:26.747 --> 02:28.837
<i>I can't move.</i>

02:31.837 --> 02:35.777
<i>I must be deep within the lower world.</i>

02:36.747 --> 02:38.477
<i>The immortal realm.</i>

02:39.217 --> 02:41.817
<i>Where the spirits reside.</i>

02:42.357 --> 02:47.477
<i>Not even the kams would venture 
so deep in search of a soul.</i>

02:48.237 --> 02:52.347
<i>Will I be held captive here 
for all eternity?</i>

02:52.347 --> 02:53.457
Brother!

02:56.097 --> 02:58.567
So this is where you were, Brother.

02:58.567 --> 03:01.067
Tolui? Why are you here?

03:02.197 --> 03:04.717
I've been searching for you, Brother.

03:04.927 --> 03:09.297
I scoured the upper and lower worlds,
and I've finally found you.

03:09.547 --> 03:11.297
Come. Let us return.

03:13.307 --> 03:14.487
Tolui.

03:15.107 --> 03:17.557
I'm afraid that's not possible.

03:18.897 --> 03:22.117
Should a single soul go missing
 from this tent,

03:22.117 --> 03:24.297
the spirits are bound to take notice.

03:24.687 --> 03:27.967
In their anger, they may visit calamity
 upon the surface.

03:40.527 --> 03:43.687
Then let me take your place.

03:44.037 --> 03:44.877
What?

03:46.587 --> 03:48.807
Tolui, you mustn't.

03:49.597 --> 03:55.327
All I know is war, and we've already 
vanquished our longtime foes, the Jin.

04:10.317 --> 04:14.787
It is you who will forge the era to come 
with your cleverness.

04:14.787 --> 04:16.247
Don't, Tolui!

04:18.207 --> 04:20.327
Farewell, Brother.

04:23.047 --> 04:24.967
Tolui!

04:25.537 --> 04:28.467
Be careful when you're back
 on the surface!

04:29.227 --> 04:33.267
Please watch over Sorghaghtani
 in my stead!

04:46.977 --> 04:48.057
Great Kha'an.

04:50.117 --> 04:51.237
You've awakened?

04:52.957 --> 04:54.457
Boraqchin?

04:55.767 --> 04:58.977
Where's Tolui? Where is he right now?

05:11.627 --> 05:12.937
Is anyone there?

05:12.937 --> 05:15.187
The Great Kha'an has come to!

05:19.357 --> 05:20.557
Tolui.

05:31.637 --> 05:34.947
<i>Sir Qadaq's tent is gone.</i>

05:36.227 --> 05:37.557
<i>But why?</i>

05:37.917 --> 05:41.297
<i>I was hoping he could tell me 
what happened to Lady Töregene.</i>

05:46.307 --> 05:47.747
This must be...

05:47.747 --> 05:49.337
Fatima!

05:50.787 --> 05:51.927
Shira?

05:53.867 --> 05:55.387
Wh-What is it?

05:57.227 --> 05:58.307
Prince Tolui has...

06:02.477 --> 06:03.267
What?

06:07.607 --> 06:09.717
It happened shortly after the exorcism.

06:16.827 --> 06:21.077
Prince Tolui suddenly had a fit
 on his way back.

06:36.737 --> 06:39.677
He managed to return
to Princess Sorghaghtani's side.

06:42.607 --> 06:45.207
But he perished soon after.

06:58.157 --> 07:02.227
Looks like he really <i>did</i> sacrifice himself
for the Great Kha'an.

07:02.657 --> 07:06.147
That can't be.
The very thought is absurd.

07:08.427 --> 07:10.187
Which would mean he was...

07:13.187 --> 07:14.647
Assassinated?

07:16.197 --> 07:19.867
Wait. With everything that's happened
 since yesterday, I'm so confused.

07:19.867 --> 07:21.557
What in the world is going on?

07:21.557 --> 07:23.077
Fatima.

07:23.077 --> 07:26.577
Perhaps it's best you don't return 
to the House of Tolui.

07:26.577 --> 07:27.217
Huh?

07:27.217 --> 07:31.187
Princess Sorghaghtani sent you 
to prevent the worst from transpiring.

07:31.507 --> 07:34.067
And yet, that's exactly what has happened.

07:34.067 --> 07:36.357
You've betrayed her trust.

07:38.157 --> 07:39.257
Besides...

07:40.167 --> 07:43.857
With Prince Tolui gone, 
his house won't last long.

07:45.367 --> 07:48.657
From now on, we may see power concentrated
in the hands of the Great Kha'an.

07:49.477 --> 07:54.117
If that's the case, I'd love to serve
 the House of Ögedei.

07:55.807 --> 07:59.507
Say, Fatima. Could you put
 in a good word for me?

08:00.977 --> 08:02.067
Are you listening?

08:11.957 --> 08:16.007
<i>Tolui sacrificed his life
for the Great Kha'an.</i>

08:17.537 --> 08:22.657
<i>That could be the truth.
Or it could very well not be.</i>

08:23.707 --> 08:30.257
<i>What's certain is the power imbalance
that had been maintained in the empire</i>

08:30.677 --> 08:35.207
<i>would shift greatly 
following Tolui's death.</i>

08:38.587 --> 08:44.567
Next, we have the jarghuchi, Shigi Qutuqu,
who will be announcing the spoils of war.

08:46.517 --> 08:49.767
Here are the men we brought 
from the Jin capital.

08:50.807 --> 08:53.887
Scholars. Physicians. Engineers.

08:53.887 --> 08:56.907
They are sure to contribute 
to our nation's development.

08:58.687 --> 09:00.567
So this is the gift you spoke of?

09:07.847 --> 09:09.607
You called for me?

09:11.327 --> 09:13.207
I heard of it from the jarghuchi.

09:13.677 --> 09:18.047
Going against the law by arguing
for more land and subjects for your son.

09:21.127 --> 09:24.637
My son made great endeavors 
during the Jin expedition!

09:24.867 --> 09:27.257
You understand that, don't you?

09:27.257 --> 09:28.467
Mother!

09:28.467 --> 09:29.627
Godan!

09:29.627 --> 09:31.637
Pardon us. Pay no heed to my mother.

09:31.637 --> 09:33.437
Godan! Let me down this instant!

09:33.437 --> 09:35.637
This is for <i>your</i> sake!

09:33.437 --> 09:36.497
Mother! Calm yourself!

09:38.637 --> 09:41.497
W-Well...

09:41.497 --> 09:43.027
That wish of yours...

09:43.467 --> 09:45.587
may be granted soon enough.

09:47.607 --> 09:48.357
Huh?

10:03.757 --> 10:05.017
There.

10:12.717 --> 10:13.867
Fatima.

10:15.437 --> 10:16.897
Empress Boraqchin.

10:19.787 --> 10:21.357
What brings you here?

10:21.357 --> 10:26.077
Your efforts have led 
to the Great Kha'an's recovery.

10:26.077 --> 10:28.267
I come with a show of my gratitude.

10:29.907 --> 10:31.967
This is for you.

10:32.967 --> 10:33.787
What?

10:35.867 --> 10:37.487
<i>Oh... </i>Elements<i>?</i>

10:37.957 --> 10:41.587
I mentioned to Sorghaghtani 
that you were seeking this book,

10:41.587 --> 10:43.967
and she gladly agreed to part with it.

10:44.847 --> 10:47.087
I was seeking it...

10:49.257 --> 10:50.627
Where did you learn of that?

10:52.257 --> 10:54.427
Did Lady Töregene tell you?

10:54.427 --> 10:55.637
Fatima.

10:56.997 --> 10:59.657
Forget about that woman.

11:01.307 --> 11:04.627
I'll have her tent dismantled 
by the end of today.

11:04.987 --> 11:07.827
You can relocate next to my tent.

11:09.277 --> 11:10.867
Empress Boraqchin.

11:10.867 --> 11:14.107
Come with me. There's something
 I want to show you.

11:26.247 --> 11:30.997
Did Princess Sorghaghtani 
relinquish all of these to you?

11:30.997 --> 11:33.847
Indeed. In all her magnanimity.

11:34.687 --> 11:37.437
B-But she said...

11:37.767 --> 11:39.267
I wish to learn more.

11:39.807 --> 11:44.317
About the many lands 
within reach of Mongol hooves.

11:45.447 --> 11:48.617
It was tragic what happened to Tolui.

11:49.067 --> 11:50.367
However...

11:51.357 --> 11:54.077
I believe it was a sign 
from the heavens.

11:55.447 --> 12:01.287
The Great Kha'an possesses the wisdom 
to lead our empire into a new age.

12:01.607 --> 12:06.127
Yet Tolui would have proved meddlesome
 in bringing this to fruition.

12:07.147 --> 12:09.317
You said as much yourself.

12:09.767 --> 12:14.347
You were afraid of the House of Tolui 
dominating in both might and intelligence.

12:16.807 --> 12:21.477
I will use this opportunity 
to correct that imbalance.

12:22.717 --> 12:23.847
Fatima.

12:24.207 --> 12:28.807
It won't be might that commands the future 
of this empire. It will be wisdom.

12:29.237 --> 12:33.577
Don't you wish to harness 
your wisdom to its fullest?

12:34.027 --> 12:37.037
What could be more enjoyable?

13:04.627 --> 13:09.897
<i>Had I stayed in Tus, I would have 
never beheld a sight so majestic.</i>

13:09.897 --> 13:13.197
I... intend to go on a journey.

13:13.467 --> 13:17.607
And engage with wisdom from any 
and all sources in search of truth.

13:22.227 --> 13:23.957
<i>Master Muhammad.</i>

13:24.477 --> 13:28.167
<i>I'll have you know 
I was so frustrated back then.</i>

13:29.377 --> 13:31.087
<i>I was filled with envy.</i>

13:31.607 --> 13:35.347
<i>You could freely journey 
wherever your heart took you.</i>

13:37.207 --> 13:43.227
<i>I've learned far more than you ever did
 in the brief time you were alive.</i>

13:44.397 --> 13:46.647
<i>Maybe it's time...</i>

13:47.887 --> 13:51.127
<i>I moved on with my life.</i>

14:05.637 --> 14:07.387
Huh? What was that?

14:07.387 --> 14:08.917
Hey. Is everything all right?

14:08.917 --> 14:11.507
I'm so sorry. This pillar toppled over.

14:12.387 --> 14:14.967
I thought lightning might have struck.

14:20.557 --> 14:22.127
They're all in a panic.

14:25.707 --> 14:28.787
At this moment in time, 
you don't know where you are,

14:28.787 --> 14:30.477
what is happening,

14:30.477 --> 14:32.637
or what is going to become of you.

14:32.637 --> 14:34.367
Your life is full of unknowns.

14:38.147 --> 14:42.247
<i>How could I think myself cleverer 
than Master Muhammad?</i>

14:43.067 --> 14:45.457
<i>Where is my place in this world?</i>

14:47.487 --> 14:49.647
<i>Euclid's </i>Elements<i>.</i>

14:50.757 --> 14:53.497
<i></i>Elements<i>, which my mistress
 tried to protect.</i>

14:54.577 --> 14:58.897
<i></i>Elements<i>, which caused 
to my mistress to lose her life.</i>

14:59.967 --> 15:03.497
<i>The man who killed my mistress is no more.</i>

15:04.667 --> 15:10.977
<i>My purpose in life was to take back 
this book as my mistress's slave.</i>

15:12.717 --> 15:14.387
Mistress Fatima.

15:14.707 --> 15:17.817
I've succeeded in what I set out to do.

15:20.357 --> 15:21.457
<i>A slave?</i>

15:25.667 --> 15:26.997
Empress Boraqchin.

15:28.327 --> 15:32.627
Were you told the reason 
for me seeking this book?

15:34.517 --> 15:38.067
That book is a treatise 
on geometry, is it not?

15:38.067 --> 15:41.807
I heard you had an interest 
in the subject for a long time.

15:42.077 --> 15:46.007
Taking after your father 
who was a scholar, I believe?

15:52.947 --> 15:55.767
Yes. It's just as you say.

16:07.827 --> 16:09.287
<i>Now I know one thing.</i>

16:10.587 --> 16:14.847
<i>Empress Boraqchin heard about this book
 from Lady Töregene.</i>

16:15.387 --> 16:18.047
<i>I can't guess at what 
might have transpired,</i>

16:18.727 --> 16:20.427
<i>but what I can say for sure is...</i>

16:21.867 --> 16:24.847
My name is Sitara. I'm a slave.

16:25.597 --> 16:30.917
That's why I chose to keep my past 
as a Merkit a secret from everyone.

16:31.627 --> 16:33.567
Please keep it a secret too.

16:33.567 --> 16:36.647
<i>Lady Töregene did not divulge...</i>

16:37.307 --> 16:39.277
<i>the secrets we shared,</i>

16:39.487 --> 16:41.307
<i>nor the anger we bear.</i>

16:59.127 --> 17:00.607
You worked hard today.

17:34.257 --> 17:35.147
Shira.

17:36.037 --> 17:37.497
Fatima?

17:37.497 --> 17:40.027
I told you not to come back.

17:40.027 --> 17:41.617
I came to ask you something.

17:42.047 --> 17:46.517
Help me out, and I can introduce you 
to the Great Kha'an or the Great Khatun.

17:46.957 --> 17:48.617
Ask me anything.

17:49.247 --> 17:52.677
You said the House of Tolui 
wouldn't last long.

17:53.007 --> 17:54.027
Why is that?

17:54.027 --> 17:56.867
Think about it. 
With Prince Tolui gone,

17:56.867 --> 17:59.837
I can't imagine Princess Sorghaghtani 
and the others who survived him

17:59.837 --> 18:01.687
will hold onto their influence.

18:02.367 --> 18:04.827
In fact, just earlier...

18:06.337 --> 18:09.687
They took away so many 
of your books, Mother.

18:10.847 --> 18:13.747
Say, are you really okay
 not saying anything?

18:14.457 --> 18:16.777
That book, <i>Elements</i>...

18:17.157 --> 18:21.207
Didn't Father bring that book 
all the way from Persia for you?

18:22.187 --> 18:23.877
It's fine.

18:25.157 --> 18:28.027
I have no need for it any longer.

18:28.707 --> 18:31.877
The Great Khatun can take all she wants.

18:32.387 --> 18:37.217
Ah, I have no interest in following 
someone who's lost all hope.

18:38.917 --> 18:39.777
Huh?

18:39.777 --> 18:42.147
It was her all along.

18:42.497 --> 18:45.767
I was at the mercy of Empress 
Boraqchin's machinations.

18:46.667 --> 18:47.987
How frustrating.

18:48.997 --> 18:52.717
I believed myself cleverer 
than everyone around me,

18:52.717 --> 18:55.167
and challenged her 
completely unaware.

19:02.097 --> 19:05.927
But now is not the time for frustration.

19:09.097 --> 19:11.057
I beg of you, Shira.

19:11.357 --> 19:12.627
Help me.

19:12.967 --> 19:15.117
There's someone I need to save right now.

19:15.117 --> 19:15.927
Chuu!

19:16.287 --> 19:19.647
H-H-Hey! Don't leave me behind!

19:21.527 --> 19:22.367
Chuu!

20:15.867 --> 20:17.007
Sir Qadaq.

20:18.097 --> 20:19.457
Fatima!

20:19.457 --> 20:20.487
How'd you find me?

20:20.487 --> 20:21.667
Here.

20:21.667 --> 20:23.697
Isn't this your branding iron?

20:27.087 --> 20:28.357
Sir Qadaq!

20:28.357 --> 20:31.747
Where is Lady Töregene? 
Please tell me she's safe!

20:35.037 --> 20:39.777
I'm doing everything I can at the moment
 to save Lady Töregene.

20:39.777 --> 20:41.917
On my master's orders, that is.

20:41.917 --> 20:43.127
Your master?

20:43.127 --> 20:44.787
Isn't that Lady Töregene?

20:44.787 --> 20:46.897
I've told you countless times she isn't.

20:49.847 --> 20:52.627
It's a long story. Come with me.

20:59.027 --> 21:01.497
Prince Güyük. I'm coming in.

21:02.917 --> 21:03.797
Oh?

21:04.447 --> 21:05.907
There's no one in here.

21:06.467 --> 21:09.837
It's me, Prince Güyük. Qadaq.

21:14.877 --> 21:16.097
Qadaq?

21:17.217 --> 21:19.887
Oh, it's just you?

21:19.887 --> 21:21.687
I thought a stranger might have—

21:23.077 --> 21:24.227
H-Hello—

21:27.457 --> 21:29.057
Qadaq! Qadaq!

21:29.057 --> 21:31.497
Who is she? Send her away!

21:31.497 --> 21:34.827
Prince Güyük is prone to swings
 in his temperament.

21:34.827 --> 21:36.497
It seems today's not your day.

21:36.957 --> 21:37.677
Out.

21:37.677 --> 21:38.627
What?

21:38.627 --> 21:40.537
Hey, you can't be serious.

21:40.827 --> 21:43.267
That's right. What's the meaning of this?

21:43.267 --> 21:44.897
Like I said—

21:44.047 --> 21:46.647
Qadaq!

21:46.647 --> 21:47.947
I beg of you!

21:47.947 --> 21:51.507
I don't know who he is, 
but Lady Töregene needs his help—

21:51.507 --> 21:53.547
This is Lady Töregene's firstborn son!

21:59.217 --> 22:00.657
Prince Güyük...

22:01.287 --> 22:04.657
is the Great Kha'an and Lady Töregene's
 firstborn son.

22:06.517 --> 22:07.477
What?

22:14.487 --> 22:18.327
Translation: John K.
Timing: Andy Ellis

22:14.487 --> 22:18.327
Editing: SMR
Quality Control: Alicia Ashby
Translation Check: Sriram Gurunathan

23:37.987 --> 23:43.257
<b>An Ungraceful Stone</b>

23:38.427 --> 23:41.147
<i>Next time: "An Ungraceful Stone."</i>
